Everything in this directory -- the 45 rule `.md` files and the two extracted
TypeScript tables under `tables/` -- is vendored verbatim from
microsoft/AI-Engineering-Coach and remains under its MIT licence, reproduced
below in full as that licence requires.

The repository's own top-level LICENSE covers this project's original code and
does NOT supersede this file for the contents of this directory.

Note on `tables/model-tiers.ts` and `tables/work-type-patterns.ts`: upstream's
per-file header

    /*--------------------------------------------------------------------
     *  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.
     *  Licensed under the MIT License. See LICENSE in the project root for
     *  license information.
     *-------------------------------------------------------------------*/

was dropped when those slices were extracted from `src/core/dsl/interpreter.ts`.
It is reproduced here rather than restored inline, because `scripts/lib/
coachtables.py` pins each file's SHA-256 against the bytes that
`extract_tables()` produces from upstream -- prepending a header would break
that re-derivation and destroy the drift check the pin exists to provide.
See `UPSTREAM.md` for the pinned commit.

